<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Acceso · App Vocacional ITTUX</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json"><meta name="theme-color" content="#00923F"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png"></head><body class="login-body"><main class="login-shell"><section class="login-brand"><img class="login-logo" src="/img/app-logo.png" alt="App Vocacional ITTUX"><p>TECNOLÓGICO NACIONAL DE MÉXICO</p><h1>App Vocacional ITTUX</h1><span>Panel institucional de orientación vocacional</span></section><section class="login-card"><p class="eyebrow">ACCESO ADMINISTRATIVO</p><h2>Bienvenido</h2><p class="login-help">Ingresa las credenciales del panel. Esta sesión se mantiene únicamente en tu navegador.</p><% if(error){ %><div class="login-error"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/login"><label>Usuario<input name="user" autocomplete="username" required autofocus placeholder="Usuario administrador"></label><label>Contraseña<div class="password-wrap"><input id="loginPassword" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="Contraseña"><button type="button" class="show-password" onclick="const x=document.getElementById('loginPassword');x.type=x.type==='password'?'text':'password'">Mostrar</button></div></label><button class="primary login-submit" type="submit">Entrar al panel</button></form><small class="login-note">App Vocacional ITTUX · Acceso restringido</small></section></main><script>if('serviceWorker' in navigator){navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js').catch(function(){})}</script></body></html>